# ── Script hints ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
HintThirdparty = Creates companies with random names, towns and contacts. Required before generating documents.
HintProduct = Inserts products/services with random types, prices and stock.
HintInvoice = Creates validated customer invoices using randomly picked existing thirdparties and products.
HintOrder = Creates validated customer orders using randomly picked existing thirdparties and products.
HintProposal = Creates proposals with random existing thirdparties and products.
HintProject = Creates projects with opportunity tracking (random status and amount).
HintStock = Adds random stock to existing products in existing warehouses. Prerequisites: products and at least one warehouse.
HintWarehouse = Creates sequentially numbered warehouses. Useful as a prerequisite before generating shipments with stock management.
HintShipment = Creates shipments from existing validated customer orders.
HintSupplierOrder = Creates validated supplier orders with random supplier thirdparties and products.
HintSupplierReception = Creates receipts from existing validated supplier orders.
HintSupplierInvoice = Creates validated supplier invoices with random supplier thirdparties and products.
HintPurge = ALWAYS start with "test" mode to preview what would be deleted. "confirm" mode actually deletes data.
DangerPurge = This script can PERMANENTLY DELETE data. DO NOT use in production.
